YoRHa-OS Cursors — vector cursors in the YoRHa-OS dark palette.

The shapes follow "NieR Cursors" by Beinsezii (https://github.com/Beinsezii/NieR-Cursors), and the
two loading cursors (Loading_Circle, Cursor_Loading) use its rendered frames, recolored. NieR
